        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 138,
        "headingId": 766,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>2F22 &amp; XH0489 Benign neoplasms of epidermal appendages &amp; Tumour of follicular infundibulum</p>\r\n",
